er crosses it."],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"806a2070fa-PAGE_WIDTH_VAR","usedBy":[]},{"name":"MODAL_TEXT_FACTOR","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":100,"sig":"const MODAL_TEXT_FACTOR = 0.97","type":"","doc":["Every text in the box is this much smaller than the size the screen gives it. I asked for it on 10 Nov 2026 for the widest box, a table of 4+ columns (\"a very small amount\"), and for the normal width on 11 Nov 2026: 3%, so a 15 px text is drawn at 14.5 px. The factor multiplies the text scale (--omni-k) of the card, which every text size and line height of the modal already follows (omniScale.css), so nothing can escape it and the proportions stay as they were. The amount is written only here: change it here."],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"806a2070fa-MODAL_TEXT_FACTOR","usedBy":[]},{"name":"MD_BREAKPOINT_PX","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":101,"sig":"const MD_BREAKPOINT_PX = 768","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"806a2070fa-MD_BREAKPOINT_PX","usedBy":[]},{"name":"RevealField","kind":"type","exported":false,"line":104,"generics":"","sig":"\"mobile\" | \"email\" | \"ticket\" | \"sailpno\"","doc":["these are the fields I let a signed-in person reveal on a card, each time they press it (the server logs it): the mobile number, the e-mail, the SAIL P.No. and the ticket number"],"id":"806a2070fa-RevealField","usedBy":[]},{"name":"Revealed","kind":"type","exported":false,"line":105,"generics":"","sig":"Partial<Record<RevealField, string>>","doc":[],"id":"806a2070fa-Revealed","usedBy":[]},{"name":"MASK_BUTTON","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":106,"sig":"const MASK_BUTTON = \"cursor-pointer rounded px-0.5 underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:text-emerald-70 …","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"806a2070fa-MASK_BUTTON","usedBy":[]},{"name":"PersonRow","kind":"component","exported":false,"isDefault":false,"async":false,"line":108,"sig":"function PersonRow({ emp, rev, authStatus, co